('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010','Chemical Reactions and Equations','Chemistry','Class 10','How to read, write and balance chemical equations, recognise the main reaction types, and explain redox, energy changes and everyday corrosion. A complete Class 10 foundation course.','published'),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011','Real Numbers and Polynomials','Mathematics','Class 10','Euclid''s division algorithm, prime factorisation, irrational numbers, polynomial zeros and the division algorithm, with worked reasoning for each method. A complete Class 10 foundation course.','published'),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012','Life Processes','Biology','Class 10','Nutrition, respiration, transport and excretion in plants and humans, with the structures, equations and control ideas needed to explain how life is maintained. A complete Class 10 foundation course.','published'),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013','First Flight: Reading, Writing and Grammar','English','Class 10','Build comprehension, poetry analysis, grammar accuracy and exam-ready writing. Each concept teaches a repeatable method with examples you can apply to any First Flight text. A complete Class 10 foundation course.','published'),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014','Some Basic Concepts of Chemistry','Chemistry','Class 11','The mole, stoichiometry, solution concentration and formula determination: the quantitative toolkit used in every later chemistry chapter. A complete Class 11 foundation course.','published'),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015','Sets, Relations and Functions','Mathematics','Class 11','Set language and operations, relations and their properties, functions, domains and graphs. The language behind almost every later mathematics topic. A complete Class 11 foundation course.','published'),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016','Cell: Structure and Function','Biology','Class 11','Cell theory, organelles, biomolecules and the cell cycle: how cells are built, how they work and how they divide. A complete Class 11 foundation course.','published'),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000017','Hornbill: Reading and Writing','English','Class 11','Close reading of prose and poetry, efficient note-making and summarising, and the advanced writing formats expected in Class 11. A complete Class 11 foundation course.','published'),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000018','Solutions and Electrochemistry','Chemistry','Class 12','Concentration, colligative properties, galvanic cells, the Nernst equation and electrolysis. The quantitative chemistry of solutions and electrical energy. A complete Class 12 foundation course.','published'),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000019','Matrices and Determinants','Mathematics','Class 12','Matrix operations, inverses, determinants and solving systems of linear equations. The core linear-algebra toolkit for Class 12. A complete Class 12 foundation course.','published'),
